{"id": 1326, "title": "Pressure", "level": "Intermediate", "hsk_tags": ["HSK3"], "slug": "pressure-story", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/1326_pressure-story.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["我今年来中国学习汉语，这是我第一次出国。陌生的环境让我很紧张，因为我哪儿都不熟悉。学汉语不容易，每个月都要准备考试，这让我压力很大，状态也很差，经常丢三落四。后来，我的同学和老师一起帮助我，他们建议我要劳逸结合。我选择了练瑜伽。运动真的可以减压，出汗让我觉得非常舒服。我还因为运动，结识了很多朋友。我还把这些新朋友逐一介绍给我的同学。我要把我的方法告诉大家，或许可以帮助更多的人。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["我今年來中國學習漢語，這是我第一次出國。陌生的環境讓我很緊張，因為我哪兒都不熟悉。學漢語不容易，每個月都要準備考試，這讓我壓力很大，狀態也很差，經常丟三落四。後來，我的同學和老師一起幫助我，他們建議我要勞逸結合。我選擇了練瑜伽。運動真的可以減壓，出汗讓我覺得非常舒服。我還因為運動，結識了很多朋友。我還把這些新朋友逐一介紹給我的同學。我要把我的方法告訴大家，或許可以幫助更多的人。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["wǒ jīn nián lái Zhōng guó xué xí Hàn yǔ， zhè shì wǒ dì yī cì chū guó。 mò shēng de huán jìng ràng wǒ hěn jǐn zhāng， yīn wèi wǒ nǎ r dōu bù shú xi。 xué Hàn yǔ bù róng yì， měi gè yuè dōu yào zhǔn bèi kǎo shì， zhè ràng wǒ yā lì hěn dà， zhuàng tài yě hěn chà， jīng cháng diū sān là sì。 hòu lái， wǒ de tóng xué hé lǎo shī yī qǐ bāng zhù wǒ， tā men jiàn yì wǒ yào láo yì jié hé。 wǒ xuǎn zé le liàn yú jiā。 yùn dòng zhēn de kě yǐ jiǎn yā， chū hàn ràng wǒ jué de fēi cháng shū fu。 wǒ hái yīn wèi yùn dòng， jié shí le hěn duō péng you。 wǒ hái bǎ zhè xiē xīn péng you zhú yī jiè shào gěi wǒ de tóng xué。 wǒ yào bǎ wǒ de fāng fǎ gào su dà jiā， huò xǔ kě yǐ bāng zhù gèng duō de rén。"], "english_paragraphs": ["I came to China this year to study Chinese. It’s my first time abroad, and the unfamiliar surroundings made me nervous because I didn’t know my way around. Learning Chinese isn’t easy. I have to prepare for an exam every month, which puts me under a lot of pressure. I haven’t been doing well and often forget things. Later, my classmates and teachers helped me. They suggested that I balance studying with rest, so I decided to try yoga. Exercise really does relieve stress, and working up a sweat makes me feel great. I’ve also made many friends through exercise, and I introduced each of them to my classmates. I want to share what worked for me with everyone. Maybe it can help more people."], "english_full": "I came to China this year to study Chinese. It’s my first time abroad, and the unfamiliar surroundings made me nervous because I didn’t know my way around. Learning Chinese isn’t easy. I have to prepare for an exam every month, which puts me under a lot of pressure. I haven’t been doing well and often forget things. Later, my classmates and teachers helped me. They suggested that I balance studying with rest, so I decided to try yoga. Exercise really does relieve stress, and working up a sweat makes me feel great. I’ve also made many friends through exercise, and I introduced each of them to my classmates. I want to share what worked for me with everyone. Maybe it can help more people.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ\" data-defn=\"I; me; my\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jīn nián\" data-defn=\"this year\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">今年</span><span class=\"tr\">今年</span><rt>jīn nián</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"lái\" data-defn=\"to come\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">来</span><span class=\"tr\">來</span><rt>lái</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Zhōng guó\" data-defn=\"China\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">中国</span><span class=\"tr\">中國</span><rt>Zhōng guó</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xué xí\" data-defn=\"to learn / to study\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">学习</span><span class=\"tr\">學習</span><rt>xué xí</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Hàn yǔ\" data-defn=\"Chinese language\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">汉语</span><span class=\"tr\">漢語</span><rt>Hàn yǔ</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhè\" data-defn=\"this; these\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">这</span><span class=\"tr\">這</span><rt>zhè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shì\" data-defn=\"to be (followed by